\hline Treatment Assignment & Approximately 950 participants will be randomized 1:1 into the following 2 treatment arms: pembrolizumab 200 mg or matching placebo (saline 200 mg infusion) administered IV Q3W. Stratification factors are provided in Section 7.3.1. \\
